ittle more modern  then you won't be disappointed by door  kickers from three men studio kill house  games door kickers is a top-down  realtime strategy game where you take  charge of a SWAT team during tactical  interventions and yes you certainly kick  down a lot of doors you'll have to  choose the appropriate gear settle the  movements and actions of your squad by  planning waypoints and giving specific  orders and  and press go to let your little dudes  execute your plan if it sounds tricky  that's because it is luckily you can  pause as you proceed through the mission  to change your plan on the fly if things  start to go awry with your original  tactics but if you can make the right  calls the criminal scum won't stand a  chance  let me know down in the comments if  you're keen to play battlefield hardline  or if there's another cops-and-robbers a  sort of game that gets your vote I'll  see you again next week
 

